### 查看策略（Cursor REST Client 可直接执行）
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/v1/strategies

### 列出选股策略
GET http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/v1/screeners

### 历史日期选股
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/v1/screens
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy_id":"zettaranc_b1_discipline","date":"2026-07-10","universe":"沪深京","limit":100,"params":{}}

### 运行恒生电子双均线案例
POST http://127.0.0.1:8766/api/v1/backtests
Content-Type: application/json

{"strategy_id":"ma_cross","code":"600570","capital":1000000,"commission":0.0003,"slippage":0.0001,"params":{"fast":10,"slow":30}}
